## 📁 Project Structure

```text
AI-Investment-Advisor/
│
├── app.py              # FastAPI application and LangGraph workflow
├── collector.py        # User profile collection
├── suggest.py          # Asset allocation generation
├── rec.py              # ETF recommendations
├── config.py           # Environment configuration and LLM setup
├── streamlit.py        # Streamlit frontend
├── .gitignore          # Files excluded from Git
├── README.md           # Project documentation
└── .env                # API key configuration (not uploaded)
```

