## ⚙️ Installation

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/nazneen-fatima/AI-Investment-Advisor.git
```

### 2. Navigate to the project

```bash
cd AI-Investment-Advisor
```

### 3. Create a virtual environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

### 4. Activate the virtual environment

### Windows

```powershell
venv\Scripts\activate
```

### Linux / macOS

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
```

### 5. Install dependencies

```bash
pip install fastapi uvicorn python-dotenv langgraph langchain-groq streamlit requests
```

---

## 🔐 Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file in the project root:

```env
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key
```

**Never commit your `.env` file or expose your API key publicly.**

The `.gitignore` file already excludes `.env`.

---

## ▶️ Running the Application

The application requires two terminals.

### Terminal 1 — Start FastAPI

```powershell
uvicorn app:app --reload
```

The API will be available at:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

FastAPI Swagger documentation:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
```

### Terminal 2 — Start Streamlit

```powershell
streamlit run streamlit.py
```

The frontend will open at:

```text
http://localhost:8501
```

---

## 🧪 Example Input

```json
{
  "age": 25,
  "goal": "wealth creation",
  "horizon": 10,
  "risk": "moderate"
}
```

### Example Workflow Output

The system may generate an allocation such as:

| Asset Class | Allocation |
| ----------- | ---------: |
| Stocks      |        70% |
| Bonds       |        25% |
| Cash        |         5% |
| **Total**   |   **100%** |

It then provides ETF suggestions corresponding to the recommended asset classes.

> The exact allocation and recommendations may vary because they are generated by the LLM based on the provided profile.

---

## 🔌 API Endpoint

### POST `/invest`

The FastAPI backend exposes a REST endpoint for generating an investment plan.

### Request

```json
{
  "age": 25,
  "goal": "wealth creation",
  "horizon": 10,
  "risk": "moderate"
}
```

### Response

```json
{
  "profile": {
    "age": 25,
    "goal": "wealth creation",
    "horizon": 10,
    "risk": "moderate"
  },
  "allocation": "Generated asset allocation...",
  "recommendations": "Generated ETF recommendations..."
}
```

